from pathlib import Path
import json,sys
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];job=sys.argv[1];original=R/'preparation/jobs'/('CONSTRUCT-'+job)
ledger=json.loads((R/'receipts/NATIVE-INVOCATIONS.v1.json').read_text())
if not any(x.get('job_id')=='CONSTRUCT-'+job and x.get('join_status')=='completed' for x in ledger['agents']):raise SystemExit('Constructor FINAL not observed')
source=json.loads((original/'PAYLOAD.json').read_text());raw=R/'raw'/('CONSTRUCT-'+job+'.json');data=json.loads(raw.read_text());name='CRITIQUE-'+job;dst=R/'preparation/jobs'/name;dst.mkdir(exist_ok=False)
payload={'job_id':name,'role':'independent-critic','case_and_method_packet':source,'actual_constructor_body':data,'output_path':str(R/'raw'/f'{name}.json')}
(dst/'PAYLOAD.json').write_text(json.dumps(payload,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
prompt=f"""You are a separately spawned independent native critic for {name}, user goal run all pending strategies in native-agent scope. Read only this job PAYLOAD.json and root preparation/PROTOCOL.md. No helpers, browsing, historical archives, other role outputs, source/report/goal changes. Write exclusively {payload['output_path']} with first creation. At most 500 words per assigned card; retain all IDs.

Audit actual operation fidelity, protected source outcomes, allowed mutation/resource budgets and EVERY card-required comparison. Evidence must cite exact actual constructor field/claim and case givens. A plausible plan for a future comparison is not an actual native comparison; human outcome fields remain unavailable by selected scope. You may replay finite arithmetic in your own bounded analysis but label paper predictions versus actually executed script trace. No need reward novelty. Identify identical conventional mechanisms, label-only changes, information/budget differences, inconsistent phases, missing state, impossible claims, dropped obligations or accidental free resources. Every card needs a native verdict applied / source_backed_no_opening / incomplete plus why. Separate validity, distinct-dependency and usefulness; do not infer originality from no precedent search.

Save job_id,role,read_evidence,rows; each row strategy_id,operation_fidelity (pass/flag/block with literal evidence),artifact_validity,comparison_checks (one per required contrast with what was ACTUALLY compared and unavailable endpoints),nearest_ordinary_equivalent,novelty_ceiling,blocking_gaps,constructive_attack (failed assumption; invariant; allowed variable; useful residue),handoff (preserved facts, exact trigger/action/cost/counter/falsifier or analytical artifact, 180-250 word obligation packet),ordinary_summary (same maximum size, natural summary of same output; never invent facts),disposition,unresolved. Build handoffs directly from actual source-backed contents; must retain awkward decisive conditions. Preserve disagreement and first failures. Your handoff is an actual critic output for a later fresh builder; do not claim builder execution. Return paths and actual blockers."""
(dst/'PROMPT.md').write_text(prompt+'\n');print(name)
